    "_doc": "MANUAL-ONLY config for the Category 16 (Dietary Supplements (Human)) Program Manual landing page, consumed by tools/build-category-manual.mjs. Deliberately NOT named '*-pages.json' so tools/render-all-standard-pages.mjs does NOT pick it up. The subcategory pages are rendered from data/standards/cat16-pages.json. This manual re-presents the SAME numbers already live on those pages. cert_doi stays empty until the house deposit.",
